; HARD RULE: never emit TP < SL → TP 1620 >= SL 1200 · RR=1.35
;
; INTENT: lower BWR (need fewer wins), NOT closer TP.
;   BWR = 1/(1+R); higher R → lower BWR
;   P0/P1 Tester WR≈43% with RR=1.25 (BWR≈44.4%) → WR < BWR
;   P3: RR 1.25→1.35 → BWR 44.4%→42.6%  (if WR holds ~43%, BM flips +)
;   Closer TP would RAISE BWR (wrong direction for "fewer wins")
;   P2 fadeConfirm (magic 26100917) FAILED — do not reuse that magic
;
; Keep P1 selectivity (BBDev 2.4, CD 3, BBw min 0.35, ATR max 1000)
; PIN fade OFF — Tester sticky-inputs retained fade=1 from P2 and contaminated first blotters
